Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.79,1:28:29.31,ed_chi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)}不要忘记 在这个星球上找到的一个神奇的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.66,1:28:35.35,ed_chi,NTP,0,0,0,,它在手中微微地闪着光
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.35,1:28:43.61,ed_chi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)}它是我珍贵的宝物
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.58,1:28:57.02,ed_chi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)}曾经对你说过在天空中飞翔的梦
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.25,1:29:03.04,ed_chi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)}梦中我跨越彩虹 飞到太阳王国
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.08,1:29:12.62,ed_chi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)}到处都是洋溢的预感
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.87,1:29:25.08,ed_chi,NTP,0,0,0,,闪耀的记忆里 我们心心相印
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.10,1:29:42.74,ed_chi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)}那绚丽的苍之勇气为我们创造奇迹
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.22,1:30:04.91,ed_chi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)}我找到了藏在今天的一个神奇之处
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.01,1:30:10.69,ed_chi,NTP,0,0,0,,每当开启同一扇心扉
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.69,1:30:19.96,ed_chi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)}就会继续寻找那永恒不变的爱
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.44,1:30:32.73,ed_chi,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会忘记 在这个星球上的诞生与邂逅
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.78,1:30:45.07,ed_chi,NTP,0,0,0,,我们将会在不断重复时间里创造奇迹
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.07,1:31:11.63,ed_chi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,2000)}那绚丽的苍之勇气为我们创造奇迹
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.39,0:02:50.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,母后
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.19,0:02:53.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,母后 振作一点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.94,0:02:57.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么会这样 越来越虚弱了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.01,0:03:00.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快醒来吧 母后
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.49,0:03:03.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是诅咒 尼迪娜的诅咒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.81,0:03:05.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太可怕了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.04,0:03:06.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要慌
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.79,0:03:11.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,睡吧 直到世界末日为止
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.18,0:03:16.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诅咒玛雅娜国
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.49,0:03:23.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,母后
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.31,0:03:25.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王后陛下
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.96,0:03:28.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,母后...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.72,0:04:03.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚上好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.42,0:04:04.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.23,0:04:09.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是白雪公主吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.21,0:04:10.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么事吗 老奶奶
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.92,0:04:12.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个苹果送给你吃
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.93,0:04:14.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是魔法苹果
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.81,0:04:18.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要吃了它 什么愿望都会实现
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.39,0:04:20.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.16,0:04:22.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的愿望只有一个
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.57,0:04:25.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是希望跟王子殿下过幸福的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.16,0:04:27.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 快吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.79,0:04:38.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,睡吧 直到世界末日为止
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.82,0:05:10.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,白雪公主
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.03,0:05:14.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,公主
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.79,0:05:19.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,白雪公主
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.39,0:05:22.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,白雪公主
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.64,0:05:24.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,白雪公主
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.92,0:05:27.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下 白雪公主她...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.30,0:05:30.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.14,0:05:33.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我心爱的白雪公主啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.46,0:05:37.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像有点太过头了...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.20,0:05:39.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多么美丽的容颜
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.66,0:05:42.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多么白皙的玉手
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.40,0:05:46.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你演树的话为什么来阻碍我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.58,0:05:50.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为剧本里根本就没有握手的部分
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.55,0:05:52.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是王子就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.58,0:05:55.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且 胖虎演王子就...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.66,0:05:58.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猜拳决定的 你有意见吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.40,0:06:01.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过王子应该像我这样有风度的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.41,0:06:03.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是说我没风度吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.85,0:06:05.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,够了 你们住手
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.75,0:06:08.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样子根本无法练习了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.12,0:06:08.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.91,0:06:13.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难得我拿『万能舞台装置』给你们制造气氛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.27,0:06:15.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,练习中止
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.92,0:06:20.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们总是这么快就出问题
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.61,0:06:22.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辛苦你们了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.53,0:06:26.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样会赶不上学艺会的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.48,0:06:29.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本来我就对演《白雪公主》没什么兴趣
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.82,0:06:33.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗 我觉得是很感人的故事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.17,0:06:38.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子 公主 巫婆 真的存在吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.05,0:06:41.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道 毕竟《白雪公主》只是个童话
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.18,0:06:43.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好 我是时候去补习了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.93,0:06:45.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉我先回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.67,0:06:47.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.02,0:06:49.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 我也要回去店里帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.29,0:06:50.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎也要吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.92,0:06:52.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 这个借我用一下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.82,0:06:54.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可不行
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.44,0:06:55.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么关系嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.61,0:07:04.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 一时手滑按了老鼠军团的按键
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.45,0:07:05.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.52,0:07:06.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.87,0:07:08.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.11,0:07:09.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 振作点
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.52,0:07:12.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老鼠 老 鼠...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.46,0:07:14.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他到底想用来做什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.30,0:07:21.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿它用来做演唱会的练习是最好不过的道具了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.04,0:07:26.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超级巨星的舞台是... 这个 这个
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.31,0:07:30.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,观众有... 十万人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.37,0:07:31.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.16,0:07:56.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开唱了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.90,0:08:04.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样 今天的服装可是新的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.70,0:08:10.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天我要尽情唱啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.49,0:08:20.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 被拿走了？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.83,0:08:22.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 去要回来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.78,0:08:25.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『物件交换布』
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.62,0:08:28.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是可以将东西跟东西交换的布
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.21,0:08:30.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你有什么不要的东西吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.63,0:08:33.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要的东西... 有一袋垃圾
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.48,0:08:40.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用『交换布』包住 然后大喊要交换的东西就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.08,0:08:40.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.97,0:08:41.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.81,0:08:43.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.01,0:08:43.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交换
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.90,0:08:45.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你喊太快了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.14,0:08:51.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是胖虎 是孩子王
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.81,0:08:54.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快想办法啊 哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.76,0:09:00.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)}哆啦A梦～
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.68,0:10:21.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 我正沉浸在演唱会欢乐着的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.42,0:10:23.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么想听的话 来我家就是了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.92,0:10:27.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是有十万人观众的演唱会啊 我走了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.50,0:10:32.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来是用『万能舞台装置』开演唱会啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.05,0:10:34.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是绝对不会还回来的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.07,0:10:36.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用其他的方法吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.25,0:10:40.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『时空洞』 跟 『时空取物器』
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.55,0:10:42.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,选好时间地点
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.16,0:10:44.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后用『时空取物器』取回来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.84,0:10:47.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就选今晚的胖虎家
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.86,0:10:56.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.77,0:10:59.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,睡得很熟呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.38,0:11:01.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在枕头旁边
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.54,0:11:03.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能再靠近一点吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.71,0:11:04.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我试试
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.66,0:11:09.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OK 让我来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.95,0:11:11.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.02,0:11:12.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交给我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.22,0:11:17.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还差一点点
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.71,0:11:19.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.78,0:11:20.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.22,0:11:24.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,松不开啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.09,0:11:26.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.57,0:11:28.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.81,0:11:31.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 这是你搞的鬼吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.60,0:11:32.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆 哆啦A...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.03,0:11:34.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住 我不会放过你的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.46,0:11:39.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点 大雄 『时空洞』...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.88,0:11:49.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香 你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.24,0:11:51.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.36,0:11:55.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太胡闹了 所以『时空洞』的时空混乱了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.18,0:11:59.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这到底是怎么一回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.86,0:12:02.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发生什么事了 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.39,0:12:04.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么 不用担心
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.33,0:12:05.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.62,0:12:07.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么再联络吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.40,0:12:08.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.31,0:12:09.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.46,0:12:10.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.92,0:12:18.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.82,0:12:21.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,脏兮兮的 什么没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.77,0:12:23.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快去给我洗干净
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.73,0:13:12.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洗完舒服多了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.28,0:13:13.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.83,0:13:14.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得快点...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.75,0:13:18.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这到底是...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.85,0:13:20.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有小偷进来了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.54,0:13:21.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.94,0:13:28.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.75,0:13:32.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看那里
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.42,0:13:37.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是什么 猫吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.67,0:13:38.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心点
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.63,0:13:41.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓到了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.98,0:13:47.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是我的测验卷 还给我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.82,0:13:51.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.88,0:13:54.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 好像连接到什么地方...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.43,0:13:56.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 来一下
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.56,0:13:57.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.15,0:14:02.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.15,0:14:04.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 这是哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.20,0:14:06.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.85,0:14:08.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好茂密的丛林
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.28,0:14:24.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点回去比较好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.65,0:14:27.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我要拿回零分测验卷
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.07,0:14:31.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.27,0:14:35.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 我们不要走太远比较好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.12,0:14:36.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你逃不了的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.58,0:14:39.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.90,0:14:41.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还给我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.53,0:14:47.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.99,0:14:50.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还差一点就能拿回来的说
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.03,0:14:52.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是放弃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.72,0:14:54.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.39,0:14:57.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.97,0:15:03.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 鬼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.55,0:15:05.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点回家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.08,0:15:07.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.82,0:15:13.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.30,0:15:14.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.14,0:15:17.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.21,0:15:19.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.84,0:15:22.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都说了等等嘛...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.69,0:15:27.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 快点过来这边
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.84,0:15:30.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他好像跟我们言语不通
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.37,0:15:33.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『翻译蒟蒻』
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.15,0:15:36.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 快点
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.10,0:15:44.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请等等 我们并不是什么可疑人物
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.58,0:15:47.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.51,0:15:52.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来无法沟通了 快逃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.17,0:15:53.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.45,0:15:58.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然有这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.15,0:16:05.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竟然...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.20,0:16:09.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟大雄好像
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.84,0:16:12.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,究竟 你是什么人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.36,0:16:15.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一定是尼迪娜用妖术变出来的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.76,0:16:18.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不认识什么尼迪娜
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.08,0:16:20.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现出你的真面目吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.34,0:16:21.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,危险
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.24,0:16:23.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『魔术棒』
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.86,0:16:28.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.50,0:16:30.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又用什么妖术了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.71,0:16:32.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,逃不了的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.19,0:16:34.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.37,0:16:35.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.00,0:16:38.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 事情越来越复杂了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.33,0:17:04.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.31,0:17:09.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好 掉到沼泽去了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.03,0:17:13.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.00,0:17:13.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.37,0:17:21.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.67,0:17:22.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.20,0:17:27.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伤脑筋 这样更分不出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.61,0:17:41.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.79,0:17:44.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要这样子 快住手
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.27,0:17:48.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都说住手
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.75,0:17:52.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我 放开我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.27,0:17:57.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 帮帮我 帮帮我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.22,0:18:00.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你那是什么样子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.58,0:18:04.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要笑 快帮忙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.15,0:18:05.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波波露
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.64,0:18:09.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波波露 我在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.83,0:18:18.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想不到我们像得 连波波露都弄错
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.09,0:18:22.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 我也给弄糊涂了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.14,0:18:25.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来你们跟尼迪娜没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.81,0:18:28.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你终于明白了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.18,0:18:31.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不重要  这里到底是哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.88,0:18:35.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是太阳王国 玛雅娜国
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.73,0:18:48.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是这个国家的王子 迪奥
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.19,0:18:50.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.03,0:18:53.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 玛雅娜国是在哪儿的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.92,0:18:58.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来是『时空洞』超越了时代 跟某个地方连接了起来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.06,0:19:02.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它是我的宠物 波波露
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.29,0:19:05.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坏习惯是喜欢乱收集东西
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.32,0:19:09.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的测验卷在哪儿 还给我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.11,0:19:10.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.78,0:19:12.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们才是 从哪儿来的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.85,0:19:14.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,报上名来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.00,0:19:16.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.42,0:19:19.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,野比大雄 来自日本
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.36,0:19:21.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,日本？  从没听过
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.83,0:19:23.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在北方还是南方的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.11,0:19:26.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个...怎么说明才好呢...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.62,0:19:29.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 从这个洞穴来的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.29,0:19:32.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么说 日本就在这个洞咯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.30,0:19:35.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以说了 怎么说明才好呢...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.00,0:19:37.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,与其说明 让他看更好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.94,0:19:39.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进去了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.10,0:19:46.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这究竟是...难以置信
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.83,0:19:48.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 我们快回去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.47,0:19:50.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我等一下去 落了东西
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.88,0:19:54.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波波露 你放在去哪儿了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.87,0:20:03.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 总是「波波」叫的让人头痛的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.11,0:20:04.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可是王子殿下哦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.90,0:20:09.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波波露
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.28,0:20:19.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 还真收集了不少破烂
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.26,0:20:22.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的零分试卷 还有漫画
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.94,0:20:28.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我重要的东西 要还给我哦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.99,0:20:31.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听好 不可以再做这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.86,0:20:33.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是王子殿下的命令
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.44,0:20:34.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.59,0:20:36.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.66,0:20:39.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,确实是在这边的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.31,0:20:41.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都已经再三嘱咐要你们好好看护王子的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.73,0:20:44.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,实在很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.42,0:20:46.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之 先在这附近找找
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.94,0:20:49.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果王子有什么意外就不好了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.46,0:20:55.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波波露
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.54,0:20:57.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然在这种地方
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.83,0:21:03.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下 是时候回王宫了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.33,0:21:06.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是王子 我是野比大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.93,0:21:09.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您说什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.03,0:21:11.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下 请戴上玛雅娜的面具
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.98,0:21:14.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们将我跟迪奥弄错了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.15,0:21:15.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪奥就是王子殿下您的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.70,0:21:17.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.07,0:21:25.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.08,0:21:27.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『哆啦梦』是什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.80,0:21:36.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.36,0:21:48.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,树里面居然有这样的房间
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.32,0:21:50.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底是用什么魔法变出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.44,0:21:52.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都说了这不是魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.88,0:21:54.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.37,0:21:56.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这叫做漫画
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.30,0:21:58.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,日本的文字吗 写着些什么
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.77,0:21:59.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.62,0:22:04.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡萩 叭叭叭叭叭 糟糕 哇 多多多多
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.82,0:22:06.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无聊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.37,0:22:10.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗 不过大雄可真慢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.14,0:22:12.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.32,0:22:14.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪奥
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.27,0:22:18.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 弄的满地泥沙 被妈妈看到的话...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.65,0:22:21.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不要擅自走动啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.32,0:22:25.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啰嗦 不准对王子下命令
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.56,0:22:32.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,墙壁吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.87,0:22:44.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎光临魔术世界
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.60,0:22:47.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了 你一定是魔法师尼迪娜的手下
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.88,0:22:49.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首先小试牛刀
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.80,0:22:51.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放马过来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.20,0:22:53.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快从箱子里面出来跟我一决胜负
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.65,0:23:02.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样就吓到的话还早着呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.84,0:23:05.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶的妖术师
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.07,0:23:07.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶 给我出来
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.46,0:23:14.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,逃得真快
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.07,0:23:17.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幸好妈妈不在家
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.90,0:23:19.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.09,0:23:23.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄的妈妈 这个家里最可怕的人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.13,0:23:27.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管是谁 得罪王子的人都不可饶恕
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.38,0:23:31.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之 先洗干净身上的泥沙吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.97,0:23:33.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,普通的淋浴
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.80,0:23:35.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下雨了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.72,0:23:37.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之先洗干净
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.42,0:23:39.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瀑 瀑布...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.56,0:23:43.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『衣物瞬间干燥机』
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.63,0:23:44.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,起风了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.41,0:23:46.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很快就会干的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.69,0:23:49.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 这个国家全是魔法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.34,0:23:54.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 我饿了 拿点食物给我
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.59,0:23:57.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是任性
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.74,0:23:58.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.34,0:24:00.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么 王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.36,0:24:03.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想吃什么
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.07,0:24:08.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好冷 这股寒气是什么 快关上
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.57,0:24:12.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么吃杯面好了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.88,0:24:15.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先等我烧开水
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.15,0:24:18.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喷火了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.93,0:24:23.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这 这是什么 居然在森林的里面
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.42,0:24:26.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子 迪奥大人 回朝
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.15,0:24:58.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当王子真威风啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.61,0:25:05.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下 已经回到王宫了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.05,0:25:08.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里就是迪奥家吗
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.18,0:25:13.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我家根本没法比
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.10,0:25:16.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么 辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.27,0:25:17.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 我走了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.56,0:25:21.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下 替您更衣吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.89,0:25:24.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下怎么弄得这么脏
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.99,0:25:27.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 我自己洗就可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.65,0:25:29.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您说什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.09,0:25:31.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,饶了我吧...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.54,0:25:36.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当王子原来有这么多人伺候 真有点过意不去
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.36,0:25:42.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是威风凛凛
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.91,0:25:51.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么多好吃的 真的可以吃吗
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.66,0:25:53.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不客气了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.64,0:25:59.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吃 当王子的生活太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.48,0:26:02.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么好吃的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.34,0:26:05.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是第一次吃到
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.16,0:26:07.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真会做菜啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.15,0:26:09.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还好妈妈不在家...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.79,0:26:11.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.28,0:26:12.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈回来了...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.98,0:26:15.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 哆啦A梦 你们在吗
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.56,0:26:17.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.12,0:26:19.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 妈妈 我要跟她决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.91,0:26:23.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 还是暂时先回到丛林里去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.13,0:26:30.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃得好饱 王子的生活很适合我
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.64,0:26:34.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.73,0:26:37.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 你居然知道我在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.97,0:26:40.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波波露告诉我们的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.78,0:26:43.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.87,0:26:47.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被看到有两个王子就糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.82,0:26:49.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.70,0:26:51.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么我要藏起来
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.78,0:26:55.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么事要差遣吗
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.50,0:26:58.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事 退下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.93,0:27:05.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真厉害 大雄还真有王子的模样
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.26,0:27:06.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我请安
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.55,0:27:08.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看你又这么得意忘形...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.53,0:27:13.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有事拜托你们 跟我交换身份
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.59,0:27:16.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要我当王子？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.76,0:27:21.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 我当你 想去了解一下日本
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.07,0:27:24.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且要找寻打倒尼迪娜的方法
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.12,0:27:26.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打倒尼迪娜？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.75,0:27:42.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼迪娜曾经是玛雅娜国的神官长
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.64,0:27:46.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是后来开始使用旁门左道的妖术 迷惑民心
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.92,0:27:48.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,母后将她驱逐了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.75,0:27:53.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以尼迪娜将迪奥的妈妈诅咒以至长眠啊
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.09,0:27:56.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,注意言词 你们不可直呼我名字  要叫王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.71,0:27:59.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起 王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.43,0:28:02.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被驱逐出国家的尼迪娜
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.37,0:28:07.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在在没人敢接近的白骨森林深处的黑暗神殿里
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.08,0:28:19.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在身体日渐衰弱的母后身旁
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.75,0:28:22.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我曾向太阳之神起过誓
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.80,0:28:26.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定要打倒尼迪娜 帮母后解除诅咒
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.75,0:28:30.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了这个 我要变得更强
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.77,0:28:34.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说 只是短时间内交换应该没关系吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.02,0:28:36.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行不行 我已经觉得够烦了...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.54,0:28:38.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是为了帮助人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.98,0:28:40.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对吧 王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.78,0:28:42.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 就这么决定
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.79,0:28:45.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天开始交换 行吗
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.76,0:28:55.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.45,0:28:59.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说什么帮助人 其实是你自己想换而已吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.48,0:29:02.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被妈妈发现的话该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.20,0:29:04.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经发现了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.05,0:29:05.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.45,0:29:09.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弄得这么乱 快给我收拾干净
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.98,0:29:19.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么你们交换衣服吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.28,0:29:21.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄戴上假发
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.88,0:29:25.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子戴上帽子
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.04,0:29:28.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还要戴上没有度数的眼镜
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.65,0:29:31.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 这样就没问题了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.68,0:29:34.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁都不会发现
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.18,0:29:35.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的很像我呢
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.84,0:29:37.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然不好看 不过没办法
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.78,0:29:41.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安全起见 给你『备用百宝袋』带在身旁
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.82,0:29:43.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别太勉强
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.93,0:29:45.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.98,0:29:57.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里真大啊 很容易迷路的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.47,0:30:00.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.81,0:30:06.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,免礼 免礼 大家辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.73,0:30:08.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,心情真舒畅
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.59,0:30:12.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里在做什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.29,0:30:26.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.81,0:30:35.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 要更加积极地接近对手
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.94,0:30:38.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.88,0:30:41.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是叫我呢
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.17,0:30:44.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我正好想去接你
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.86,0:30:47.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 开始练习
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.38,0:30:53.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下 来吧 哪个方向过来都行
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.59,0:30:55.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,选你擅长的的攻击方式吧
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.41,0:30:57.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等 等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.66,0:30:59.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.53,0:31:01.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下 加油
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.93,0:31:06.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.49,0:31:07.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有破绽
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.05,0:31:11.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.57,0:31:15.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子一定是训练不足
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.29,0:31:18.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷 麻烦你照顾王子
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.06,0:31:19.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 父亲
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.59,0:31:21.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 继续练习
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.85,0:31:27.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托你不要太擅自乱动
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.04,0:31:29.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难得我们收拾干净的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.38,0:31:31.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.29,0:31:34.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.01,0:31:35.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香你好
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.78,0:31:37.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,午安
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.11,0:31:40.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 这本书从图书馆借来的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.46,0:31:42.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以用来做戏剧的参考
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.22,0:31:43.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么书 给我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.21,0:31:47.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一点用处也没有
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.37,0:31:51.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女人太碍事了 回去
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.34,0:31:56.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄你太过分了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.89,0:31:58.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香 其实他是...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.60,0:31:59.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管你了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.57,0:32:00.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 静香
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.00,0:32:05.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么做 别人当然会气跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.23,0:32:06.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这跟我无关
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.93,0:32:08.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在要出去看看
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.66,0:32:10.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随你的便
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.58,0:32:21.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么接近了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.54,0:32:27.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是可怕的怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.58,0:32:30.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能大意
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.57,0:32:33.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道是...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.99,0:32:42.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真危险
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.59,0:32:45.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 飞上天了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.07,0:32:46.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要乱动
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.91,0:32:53.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,野比 你...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.95,0:32:57.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老师 很抱歉 这是有很复杂的原因的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.73,0:32:59.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上帮你收拾好
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.94,0:33:07.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您醒过来了啊 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.48,0:33:09.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.74,0:33:13.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下不要开玩笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.66,0:33:14.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是谷谷啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.39,0:33:17.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你叫谷谷啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.08,0:33:20.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下 难道是被爸爸打到的关系...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.37,0:33:24.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 没事 我很精神
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.34,0:33:28.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.66,0:33:31.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.43,0:33:33.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经打磨好了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.53,0:33:35.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.42,0:33:37.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望王子殿下能戴上它
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.66,0:33:39.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.42,0:33:41.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.60,0:33:45.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎样 合适吗 我会好好珍惜的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.15,0:33:49.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎 怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.43,0:33:53.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没 只是觉得王子殿下跟平时不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.47,0:33:58.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下这么高兴 还是第一次见到
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.33,0:34:00.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得很幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.04,0:34:04.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为这个收到这条项链 所以特别高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.42,0:34:07.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷 我想出去散步 帮我带路吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.76,0:34:15.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下说要自己一个人出去真少有
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.11,0:34:16.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.10,0:34:19.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过《白雪公主》里面的王子就是一个人出去的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.60,0:34:21.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得那是好事
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.65,0:34:29.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,轮到我了 去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.25,0:34:34.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些小孩子在做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.59,0:34:38.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用绳子玩占卜 王子不是也玩过的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.20,0:34:41.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么嘛 真不走运
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.78,0:34:43.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是第一名
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.30,0:34:45.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很有趣的样子 让我也加入吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.63,0:34:53.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 怎么了 为什么要逃啊 回来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.21,0:34:59.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家为什么要逃走呢
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.75,0:35:02.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为突然见到王子的关系
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.06,0:35:06.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知不觉地玩起翻花绳了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.13,0:35:09.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好漂亮 形状好像蝴蝶
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.38,0:35:11.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗 那么...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.33,0:35:15.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是鱼对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.36,0:35:16.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,扫帚
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.64,0:35:18.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 这次是...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.36,0:35:20.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,桥
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.82,0:35:23.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 这是什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.31,0:35:24.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.79,0:35:26.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是花 王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.24,0:35:29.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.73,0:35:34.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 这个什.......么
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.99,0:35:35.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,树
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.81,0:35:37.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不对 是枪
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.68,0:35:40.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惜  是东京铁塔
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.39,0:35:41.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,东京铁塔？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.99,0:35:44.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,东京铁塔是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.43,0:35:47.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 对啊 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.15,0:35:49.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下 是怎么做到的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.40,0:35:51.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也想学 可以教我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.26,0:35:52.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也想
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.76,0:35:55.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊 那就教你们吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.99,0:35:59.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个怪物的真面目是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.34,0:36:03.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不是怪物 是叫车的交通工具
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.41,0:36:06.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请你不要一个人出去好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.34,0:36:08.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要对我下命令
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.09,0:36:09.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.33,0:36:13.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.14,0:36:14.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.68,0:36:15.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这家伙是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.93,0:36:18.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然叫我「这家伙」
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.77,0:36:22.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 说去什么学艺会练习
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.87,0:36:24.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实是跑去玩
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.10,0:36:27.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我 无礼的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.91,0:36:33.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是在玩 我可是肩负重大的使命
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.65,0:36:35.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要说梦话
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.47,0:36:37.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去给我除草
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.56,0:36:39.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可是王子
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.83,0:36:43.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是王子的话 妈妈就是女王
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.26,0:36:46.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快去除草
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.14,0:36:47.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.19,0:36:48.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我早就说过了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.23,0:36:56.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下 玉米
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.34,0:36:58.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的有点像了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.84,0:37:02.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天再不下雨的话就惨了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.30,0:37:04.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是尼迪娜的诅咒吗
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.70,0:37:08.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女王陛下也是因为她 直到现在还长眠着
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.20,0:37:09.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天知道会怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.94,0:37:13.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼迪娜是 那个...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.36,0:37:17.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都怕她 一切都是因为她的诅咒
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.32,0:37:20.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不下雨 并不是因为什么诅咒
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.43,0:37:24.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那为什么还要举行活祭品仪式
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.08,0:37:26.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,活祭品
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.73,0:37:54.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神圣之泉塞纳迪啊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.34,0:37:57.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在献上我们的活祭品
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.50,0:37:59.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请解除尼迪娜的诅咒
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.90,0:38:01.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让上天赐予我们雨水吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.76,0:38:07.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你去吧 永远伺候在神的旁边
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.34,0:38:10.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.88,0:38:11.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.87,0:38:13.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 住手
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.88,0:38:16.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下 您这是怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.87,0:38:20.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我绝对不允许进行活祭品仪式
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.17,0:38:24.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您说什么 王子殿下不是也已经同意了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.53,0:38:27.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说不行就是不行
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.57,0:38:30.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能不理会等待雨水的民众
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.42,0:38:32.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你快点去
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.28,0:38:35.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 只要下雨就行了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.40,0:38:40.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『气象盒』
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.67,0:38:43.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还好带着『备用百宝袋』来
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.51,0:38:46.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放入『雨云卡』
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.10,0:38:49.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下雨了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.51,0:38:57.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是奇迹 不用献上活祭品也能下雨了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.09,0:38:59.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.71,0:39:02.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下 到底是怎样做到的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.86,0:39:05.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之 这样仪式可以终止了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.81,0:39:26.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子什么时候拥有如此的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.63,0:39:31.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时日临近 我们报仇的日子快到了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.61,0:39:34.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们也差不多该出场了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.05,0:39:43.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辛苦了 你很少这么勤奋呢
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.32,0:39:46.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有生以来 还是第一次除草
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.87,0:39:49.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喝点东西吧 王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.31,0:39:54.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个真可口
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.26,0:39:57.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮助人后喝的东西是不是特别清爽可口
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.25,0:39:59.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,母后
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.69,0:40:03.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了 大雄 说我是母后...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.25,0:40:15.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么王子殿下 明天也交换吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.58,0:40:19.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 我学到不少了 哆啦梦
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.12,0:40:23.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫哆啦A梦 给我记好名字
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.19,0:40:25.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 还那么任性
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.27,0:40:27.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一辈子做王子也无所谓哦
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.68,0:40:29.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.81,0:40:34.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里有个叫谷谷 像静香般温柔的女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.09,0:40:36.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.06,0:40:37.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.67,0:40:39.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 没什么...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.83,0:40:42.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真期待明天
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.15,0:40:55.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.18,0:40:56.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.58,0:40:58.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我 谷谷
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.33,0:40:59.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.39,0:41:01.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天的王子殿下真威风啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.93,0:41:04.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实我也不同意活祭品仪式的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.46,0:41:07.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来就是想说这个的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.29,0:41:08.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没其他事了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.00,0:41:10.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.27,0:41:14.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很忙 退下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.46,0:41:15.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.22,0:41:38.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我认输了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.23,0:41:40.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莫加 太没用了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.09,0:41:41.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡奥 过来
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.97,0:41:46.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,认输了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.60,0:41:50.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真没用 算了 回家睡觉去
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.83,0:41:52.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢殿下指导
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.39,0:41:59.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 去看看母后吧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.14,0:42:03.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么晚突然被叫出来
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.95,0:42:06.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子也太任性了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.82,0:42:10.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是也不能违抗他啊
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.19,0:42:14.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,偶尔输给他 让他高兴是最好的做法
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.34,0:42:16.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子保护得了这个国家吗
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.00,0:42:25.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,母后 请告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.45,0:42:26.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎样才能变强
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.69,0:42:32.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎样才能做个像父王那样称职的玛雅娜国国王—『太阳王』
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.77,0:42:37.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,母后 我还不够成熟
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.10,0:42:54.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.82,0:42:58.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接着 今天做什么好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.53,0:43:00.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.05,0:43:00.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.83,0:43:03.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我伊沙姆
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.51,0:43:05.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是来接您去接受棒术练习的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.69,0:43:16.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站在这种地方很危险的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.49,0:43:18.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.15,0:43:22.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 太胡闹了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.70,0:43:24.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到了吧 哆啦梦 是我赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.89,0:43:26.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.43,0:43:27.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哟 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.67,0:43:29.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最坏的事情发生了...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.75,0:43:33.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之前的晚上你那强力胶可把我给害惨了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.67,0:43:36.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天我是来还给你的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.44,0:43:37.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 其实...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.85,0:43:38.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无礼的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.89,0:43:42.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这下子...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.60,0:43:44.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有种就跟我去空地
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.42,0:43:45.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求之不得
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.76,0:43:51.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在才开始决胜负
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.29,0:43:52.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.21,0:43:52.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.89,0:43:54.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么办 怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.59,0:44:01.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.58,0:44:05.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.59,0:44:11.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我认输了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.10,0:44:13.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底怎么了 昨天也是...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.71,0:44:16.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一点也不像平时的王子
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.38,0:44:19.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请站起来 直到你恢复平时的身手
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.97,0:44:21.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天要好好练习
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.94,0:44:24.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.72,0:44:32.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天的大雄太过棘手了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.03,0:44:36.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也不赖嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.06,0:44:37.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 胜负...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.28,0:44:42.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们到此为止吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.88,0:44:42.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(432,438)\fs25}胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.91,0:44:44.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直到谁先死为止
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.59,0:44:46.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.99,0:44:48.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.85,0:44:52.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄你怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.50,0:44:57.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我最讨厌这样的大雄了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.53,0:45:03.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.22,0:45:08.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实这个大雄 并不是真正的大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.68,0:45:14.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.37,0:45:15.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.72,0:45:17.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.27,0:45:20.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我受不了棒术练习
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.40,0:45:23.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你果然不是大雄啊
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.12,0:45:27.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的分不出来呢
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.48,0:45:30.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么说 这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.13,0:45:33.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 这位是王子殿下咯
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.07,0:45:35.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(432,438)\fs25}遇到了各种各样的事
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.37,0:45:36.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(432,438)\fs25}有些什么
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.17,0:45:36.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(432,438)\fs25}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.90,0:45:37.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(432,438)\fs25}然后呢
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.71,0:45:39.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(432,438)\fs25}嗯 果然...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.51,0:45:35.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难怪这么强
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.78,0:45:37.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也不赖
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.95,0:45:40.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,够资格做玛雅娜国的战士
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.15,0:45:41.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.41,0:45:43.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有座很宏伟的金字塔
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.79,0:45:47.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有很多珍贵的动物 就好像...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.13,0:45:48.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,童话世界
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.55,0:45:49.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.53,0:45:52.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 也带我们去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.52,0:45:53.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.73,0:45:57.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下 拜托了 带我们去玛雅娜国吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.24,0:45:59.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 我招待大家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.78,0:46:03.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 决定好了 出发去玛雅娜国
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.31,0:46:09.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 这样子不行 要换好玛雅娜国的服装
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.86,0:46:12.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『换衣服照相机』
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.63,0:46:25.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里就是玛雅娜国吗
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.77,0:46:27.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是丛林而已啊
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.63,0:46:29.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王宫在这前面
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.09,0:46:31.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好美丽的绿色
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.68,0:46:34.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不好呢 居然要这样子...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.51,0:46:37.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为被看到有两位王子就糟糕了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.51,0:46:38.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.21,0:46:40.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很适合你啊 雄子
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.56,0:46:43.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托 不要这样子啦
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.47,0:46:44.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.20,0:46:57.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 这里就是王子的寝室吗
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.36,0:46:58.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好大啊
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.81,0:47:00.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全部是用石头做的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.86,0:47:03.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外面更宏伟哦
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.27,0:47:05.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下 是我谷谷
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.74,0:47:10.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用怕 他们是日本国来的我的客人
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.81,0:47:13.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个 我爸爸在找您
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.12,0:47:16.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.13,0:47:19.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么你带大家去参观玛雅娜国吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.45,0:47:22.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 我叫谷谷
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.59,0:47:24.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫静香
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.07,0:47:25.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.80,0:47:28.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,偶叫 不 我叫雄子
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.36,0:47:29.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.71,0:47:31.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.20,0:47:33.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 谷谷 拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.60,0:47:34.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.46,0:47:36.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,犀利
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.90,0:47:39.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然看过遗迹的照片
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.15,0:47:41.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,实物原来是这么漂亮的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.71,0:47:43.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能来太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.24,0:47:44.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.86,0:47:51.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是市集
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.41,0:47:53.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真热闹呢
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.62,0:47:59.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波波露
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.43,0:48:04.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真少有啊 居然跟王子殿下以外的人亲近
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.12,0:48:07.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我是容易跟动物友好的类型...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.94,0:48:17.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是斗技场
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.40,0:48:21.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛雅娜国的男性 从小就要接受棒术练习
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.53,0:48:24.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(432,438)\fs25}讨厌
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.77,0:48:25.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也想试试看
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.79,0:48:29.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷 找到王子殿下了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.28,0:48:30.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 父亲
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.58,0:48:32.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下跟这些客人在房里
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.58,0:48:34.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.02,0:48:38.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家好 都过了练习时间了 王子殿下却...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.11,0:48:41.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大叔 请教我棒术
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.28,0:48:43.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.03,0:48:46.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是日本国来的王子殿下的客人
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.53,0:48:48.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,日本？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.05,0:48:51.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 好吧 我就教你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.45,0:48:54.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的很谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.01,0:48:55.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.05,0:48:56.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放心 放心
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.98,0:48:59.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爸爸是玛雅娜国的棒术教练
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.92,0:49:01.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家不用担心
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.43,0:49:03.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.82,0:49:11.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后 白雪公主跟王子终于能在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.08,0:49:13.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过着幸福快乐的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.21,0:49:16.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎样 是不是很感人的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.07,0:49:17.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 很感人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.92,0:49:20.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪奥王子是怎样的人
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.84,0:49:23.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然有点不容易亲近
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.84,0:49:26.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最近却变得很温柔
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.69,0:49:31.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 还教会了我玩翻花绳
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.12,0:49:36.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你不能跟谷谷说交换身份的事
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.29,0:49:44.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鳄鱼 鳄鱼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.19,0:49:45.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.36,0:49:46.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.34,0:49:49.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这条河没有鳄鱼的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.40,0:49:52.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我确实看到的 很大的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.14,0:49:55.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你的倒影吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.16,0:49:57.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 的确是看到了啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.06,0:50:04.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.78,0:50:14.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下 表演翻花绳给我们看看好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.18,0:50:16.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求求你表演一下
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.14,0:50:18.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放肆 走开
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.40,0:50:20.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们以为王子殿下是什么人
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.37,0:50:21.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走开
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.44,0:50:31.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好 就这样子
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.39,0:50:34.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好 记住刚刚的呼吸方法
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.29,0:50:37.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 伊沙姆老师 再一次好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.32,0:50:38.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.88,0:50:41.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡奥 那家伙真行呢
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.42,0:50:44.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然第一次接触 却学得很快
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.53,0:50:47.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,厉害 说不定连任性王子都不是他的对手呢
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.27,0:50:51.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡奥 莫加
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.39,0:50:53.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.02,0:50:56.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们去球技场准备沙加地
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.07,0:50:58.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沙加地
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.19,0:50:59.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.10,0:51:02.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下要进行沙加地
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.94,0:51:04.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会这样
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.56,0:51:08.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下要进行沙加地
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.11,0:51:13.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷小姐 不好了 王子殿下要进行沙加地
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.83,0:51:15.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.63,0:51:18.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沙加地是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.09,0:51:20.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛雅娜国流传下来的球技
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.99,0:51:27.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,方法是使用脚控球射入对方龙门
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.46,0:51:30.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最先取得三分就算胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.57,0:51:33.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟足球一样嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.16,0:51:35.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那为什么这么紧张
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.08,0:51:55.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为这场比赛 是必须以性命做赌注的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.95,0:52:01.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,败者要听凭对方的任何要求
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.82,0:52:04.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使是被对方夺取性命
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.17,0:52:06.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然这样
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.09,0:52:08.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下只有一个人而已
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.06,0:52:09.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样怎么比
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.11,0:52:16.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听好了 认真地来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.36,0:52:17.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.00,0:52:19.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,认真可以吗 王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.08,0:52:52.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.95,0:52:55.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太过分了 刚刚犯规啊
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.12,0:52:57.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,手没碰到球就不算的
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.51,0:52:59.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然有这种规则
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.03,0:53:01.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶 这次一定要...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.77,0:53:17.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赢定了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.24,0:53:20.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样下去 王子殿下的性命...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.60,0:53:22.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个人对两个人太勉强了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.42,0:53:24.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.90,0:53:26.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.64,0:53:32.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,偶 不 我来帮王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.58,0:53:35.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.40,0:53:40.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不需要你帮忙 回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.49,0:53:46.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下 虽然我来帮忙可能帮不了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.23,0:53:50.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 我不认为一加一会小于一
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.55,0:53:54.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为 你并非孤单一人的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.48,0:53:57.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.14,0:53:59.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们这边用两个人继续比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.35,0:54:02.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多一个人又怎样 只不过是女孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.53,0:54:06.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们上 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.92,0:54:07.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OK
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.23,0:54:14.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.45,0:54:24.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我 放开我
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.83,0:54:26.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做的好 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.63,0:54:33.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.73,0:54:34.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.57,0:54:35.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做到了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.34,0:54:40.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进了 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.02,0:54:49.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,球呢
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.81,0:55:02.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.16,0:55:03.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,同分了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.54,0:55:05.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 只差一分而已
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.11,0:55:08.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,输了就糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.11,0:55:09.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.62,0:55:23.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.89,0:55:26.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做的好 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.48,0:55:33.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.41,0:55:40.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.28,0:55:42.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.15,0:55:43.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.42,0:55:47.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 我们赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.02,0:55:48.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了 王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.66,0:55:59.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下 请对他们进行处分
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.65,0:56:01.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 就交给你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.98,0:56:03.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随你怎么处置
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.89,0:56:05.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交给我？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.57,0:56:06.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.66,0:56:08.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 饶了他们吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.93,0:56:10.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 饶了他们？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.69,0:56:15.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 大家都很努力 玩得很开心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.54,0:56:16.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.71,0:56:18.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是说了随我处置的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.69,0:56:20.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以 饶了他们
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.12,0:56:23.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.54,0:56:26.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡奥 莫加 这次就放过你们
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.55,0:56:29.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感谢圣恩
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.85,0:56:34.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.43,0:56:36.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄那家伙真有气度啊
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.43,0:56:38.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.69,0:56:39.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.17,0:56:52.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,母后 虽然那帮人有点奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.47,0:56:54.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他们是我的得力伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.67,0:56:57.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.53,0:56:58.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.53,0:57:00.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我做到了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.75,0:57:03.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看 东京铁塔
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.58,0:57:06.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么 真无聊
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.63,0:57:11.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我最讨厌这样的大雄了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.44,0:57:15.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.64,0:57:40.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.26,0:58:02.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.35,0:58:10.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.57,0:58:16.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个是...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.47,0:58:17.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.07,0:58:25.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子 谷谷被我带走了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.72,0:58:27.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个声音是 尼迪娜
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.32,0:58:30.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要用她做食之仪式的祭品
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.41,0:58:32.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.14,0:58:38.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想救她的话就自己一个人来黑暗神殿
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.55,0:58:40.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记得是自己一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.63,0:58:51.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.15,0:58:51.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我卡奥
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.81,0:58:53.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我莫加也在
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.20,0:58:55.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚刚的话都听到了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.15,0:58:58.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 真的太可怕了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.07,0:59:01.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听好 这事千万不能对其他人说
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.14,0:59:05.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会照尼迪娜说的自己一个人去救谷谷
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.50,0:59:07.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不准对其他人说 这是命令
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.78,0:59:09.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.27,0:59:19.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下 谷谷
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.55,0:59:23.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们到底去了哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.02,0:59:24.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊沙姆师傅
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.58,0:59:26.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.73,0:59:28.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.03,0:59:29.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是说了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.06,0:59:30.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.38,0:59:32.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.13,0:59:35.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下呢 去了哪儿呢 王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.43,0:59:35.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(432,438)\fs25}好 加油吧
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.41,0:59:36.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(432,438)\fs25}早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.81,0:59:37.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.97,0:59:39.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.14,0:59:40.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.67,0:59:41.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您平安无事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.86,0:59:45.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟了 忘了戴假发
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.05,0:59:47.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经救了谷谷大人了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.18,0:59:50.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷她怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.72,0:59:53.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨晚被尼迪娜掠走了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.27,0:59:56.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底发生了什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.73,0:59:59.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实 我是...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.48,1:00:01.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.64,1:00:03.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是真正的王子
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.23,1:00:05.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么说谷谷跟...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.07,1:00:06.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.29,1:00:08.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去了黑暗神殿
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.69,1:00:10.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太鲁莽了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.24,1:00:12.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊沙姆师傅
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.25,1:00:14.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.41,1:00:15.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.35,1:00:18.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼迪娜说要王子一个人去...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.61,1:00:21.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们什么也没听到 再见
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.88,1:00:30.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,错不了 王子殿下去救谷谷了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.92,1:00:33.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下的枪跟头盔都不见了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.97,1:00:49.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在就去追王子
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.33,1:00:51.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,师傅 我们也来帮忙
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.96,1:00:55.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽说帮忙 但尼迪娜是可怕的魔法使啊
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.79,1:00:56.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那又怎样
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.95,1:01:01.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们这边可有22世纪科学的结晶 哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.87,1:01:03.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然不太可靠
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.76,1:01:05.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真失礼
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.10,1:01:08.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊沙姆先生 黑暗神殿的方向是？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.48,1:01:10.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这边的北方
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.41,1:01:13.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 用『竹蜻蜓』去追王子殿下吧
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.88,1:01:14.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.53,1:01:18.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这之前 帮忙换一下这装扮吧
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.18,1:01:20.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当雄子不是挺好的吗
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.31,1:01:20.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.98,1:01:23.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OK 来了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.77,1:01:25.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样就行了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.18,1:01:27.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么 王子殿下？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.88,1:01:29.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是看起来像而已
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.53,1:01:34.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是谷谷做的项链
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.45,1:01:37.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波波露
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.94,1:01:40.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也要一起去救谷谷啊
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.10,1:01:43.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.38,1:01:45.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 出发了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.25,1:01:53.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这真是粗暴的魔法
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.11,1:02:16.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,白骨森林
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.98,1:02:37.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 雷电把电池打出问题了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.68,1:02:39.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快降落
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.39,1:02:53.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.77,1:02:56.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人吗 救命啊
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.04,1:03:00.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波波露 怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.96,1:03:08.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.05,1:03:10.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.64,1:03:11.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.00,1:03:16.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下 撑着点
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.61,1:03:25.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.65,1:03:27.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么要来
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.16,1:03:31.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么 当然是为了帮王子跟谷谷啊
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.31,1:03:33.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这跟你们没关系
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.38,1:03:36.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会没关系 我们是朋友啊
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.78,1:03:39.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许我们跟王子的身份地位不同
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.73,1:03:42.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我觉得一加一肯定大于一
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.47,1:03:44.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们来帮忙不是理所当然的吗
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.93,1:03:47.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.07,1:03:49.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄说的对
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.13,1:03:51.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然了 朋友怎能见死不救呢
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.74,1:03:52.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对吧 小夫
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.75,1:03:55.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然了 大雄 说的好
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.84,1:03:59.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下 已经没人能帮我们了哦
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.62,1:04:01.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了 大家
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.30,1:04:04.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪奥 不对 王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.04,1:04:06.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫迪奥就行了 我们是朋友嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.32,1:04:07.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪奥
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.14,1:04:10.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说起来你们站一起还真难区分谁是谁呢
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.21,1:04:11.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的呢
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.62,1:04:15.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 走吧 迪奥
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.09,1:04:23.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打听过了这座山谷有个湖
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.16,1:04:25.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,湖的对岸就是黑暗神殿
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.89,1:04:28.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个山谷真是幽深啊
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.88,1:04:30.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看不到谷底呢
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.87,1:04:34.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,掉下去就糟糕了 大家小心点
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.96,1:04:40.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到尽头了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.77,1:04:44.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 『竹蜻蜓』
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.62,1:04:48.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可能 刚刚雷把电池打到出问题了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.11,1:04:49.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这悬崖
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.92,1:04:52.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别废话了 大家爬上去
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.98,1:05:00.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走开 走开
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.48,1:05:06.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.95,1:05:09.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 没完没了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.29,1:05:11.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走开 走开
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.18,1:05:15.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 快想办法啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.09,1:05:19.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没办法 能飞到哪就是哪吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.66,1:05:21.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神啊 保佑我们 还差一点了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.98,1:05:24.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪奥 不要紧吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.20,1:05:25.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.42,1:05:26.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,师傅
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.68,1:05:27.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得救了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.59,1:05:28.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.68,1:05:30.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赶上了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.18,1:05:31.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是神奇的法术
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.93,1:05:36.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,师傅 还差一点而已 一点而已
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.45,1:05:38.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.08,1:05:39.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是惊险啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.82,1:05:46.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,师傅
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.74,1:05:48.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 危险
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.38,1:05:49.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得去救他
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.71,1:05:50.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可能的 住手
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.99,1:05:53.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 师傅他...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.67,1:05:55.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要哭哭涕涕的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.65,1:05:58.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊沙姆不是会在这种地方死掉的男人
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.45,1:05:59.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要相信他
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.10,1:06:04.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它们追来了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.43,1:06:06.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 快逃
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.14,1:06:07.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 快点
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.32,1:06:09.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,师傅 你一定...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.72,1:06:12.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定会得救的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.77,1:06:21.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我累坏了 跑不动了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.47,1:06:24.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该不会追到这里了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.32,1:06:25.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是那里
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.56,1:06:30.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那座就是黑暗神殿
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.79,1:06:43.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 我们快去救回谷谷
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.10,1:06:44.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.35,1:06:47.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很快就天黑了 夜里的森林是很危险的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.27,1:06:48.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 谷谷她...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.49,1:06:51.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼迪娜在明天正午之前都不会对谷谷怎么样的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.95,1:06:53.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.00,1:06:55.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为食之仪式是在明天正午
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.25,1:06:59.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么为了明天的战斗 今天就在这里扎营
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.19,1:07:01.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 在这之前
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.78,1:07:03.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要小便
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.67,1:07:05.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 快点哦
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.19,1:07:06.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真讨厌
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.76,1:07:16.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都说了要一个人来
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.98,1:07:19.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,却带了一堆多余的人来
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.55,1:07:23.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本来是打算用你做诱饵抓住王子的
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.56,1:07:26.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,需要的只是王子而已
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.29,1:07:30.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对于胆敢阻碍明天食之仪式的家伙 一律格杀勿论
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.00,1:07:38.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪奥也不是任性的王子嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.71,1:07:42.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他可是想努力成为一个仁王啊
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.06,1:07:44.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当真正的王子也真不简单呢
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.60,1:07:48.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄你不是想当王子...的吗
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.08,1:07:57.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正午之前要去到黑暗神殿
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.29,1:07:58.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出发吧
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.46,1:08:02.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『万能溜冰鞋』
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.28,1:08:05.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滑起来感觉怎么样
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.39,1:08:06.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.35,1:08:07.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.99,1:08:11.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点 迪奥
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.31,1:08:15.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以了 让我自己试试
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.79,1:08:17.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是迪奥
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.15,1:08:18.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我先走了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.22,1:08:19.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.83,1:08:28.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来也能在水上滑啊
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.53,1:08:31.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对啊 就这样滑过湖吧
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.28,1:08:36.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像溜冰一样
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.06,1:08:48.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪奥滑得比大雄还好呢
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.18,1:08:49.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.98,1:08:50.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.37,1:08:54.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家快逃
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.56,1:09:01.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.46,1:09:04.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(432,438)\fs25}胖虎
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.73,1:09:05.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶可恶
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.24,1:09:15.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪奥
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.23,1:09:21.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『风神扇子』
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.60,1:09:33.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪奥 迪奥
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.14,1:09:40.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鳄...鱼
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.51,1:09:41.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 王子？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.72,1:09:48.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆哆哆 哆啦A梦 快拿点什么出来啊
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.75,1:09:51.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我找我找我找我找
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.70,1:09:54.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『超级气球口香糖』
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.88,1:09:55.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃吧
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.47,1:10:04.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎 怎么了 快停下
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.57,1:10:07.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放我下去
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.59,1:10:11.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.67,1:10:12.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在不是高兴的时候
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.92,1:10:14.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快去追迪奥
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.70,1:10:21.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.45,1:10:27.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.17,1:10:35.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没想到连瀑布也能滑
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.66,1:10:37.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为这是万能型的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.88,1:10:39.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.61,1:10:55.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 动物使者雅福被打败了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.28,1:10:57.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那帮家伙到底是何方神圣
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.73,1:11:00.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,食之仪式很快就要开始的说
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.63,1:11:03.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次由我看看情况
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.87,1:11:11.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪奥
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.77,1:11:15.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐怕被带到黑暗神殿去了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.07,1:11:16.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 我们得赶快...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.28,1:11:19.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波波露 怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.66,1:11:21.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到迪奥了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.03,1:11:22.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波波露 等等
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.84,1:11:31.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波波露
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.59,1:11:40.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 快点啊
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.09,1:11:43.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然你这么说 我已经不行了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.21,1:11:45.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会跟丢的 波波露
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.80,1:11:47.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等我 没力气了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.95,1:11:48.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.68,1:11:50.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波波露
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.27,1:11:51.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.69,1:11:58.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么嘛 只是个石雕而已
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.58,1:12:01.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道哦 这在电视上看到过
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.99,1:12:03.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记得是...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.25,1:12:04.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,眼 眼睛动了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.50,1:12:11.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于来了啊 王子
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.41,1:12:13.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,石像说话了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.14,1:12:14.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可我不是...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.73,1:12:16.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先不要说话
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.51,1:12:21.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个女孩正睡在神殿顶部的祭坛上
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.68,1:12:26.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很快就要对她实行黑暗魔术－食之仪式
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.60,1:12:29.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想救她的话就来神殿顶部吧
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.89,1:12:33.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个妖怪
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.98,1:12:39.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么嘛 不过是块岩石而已
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.28,1:12:41.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能再磨蹭了 快去神殿
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.81,1:12:47.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,离正午已经没多少时间了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.41,1:12:57.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这儿了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.14,1:12:59.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里就是黑暗神殿了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.05,1:13:10.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那里的顶部
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.46,1:13:16.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.76,1:13:21.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子终于来了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.45,1:13:23.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子以外的全部抹杀
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.93,1:13:26.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷 我马上来救你
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.31,1:13:51.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.85,1:14:01.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么事也没有
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.93,1:14:03.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.60,1:14:08.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,穿过去了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.77,1:14:11.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来如此 这只是幻象而已
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.71,1:14:12.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幻象？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.46,1:14:17.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定有控制幻象的人
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.13,1:14:29.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听好 王子 想救大家就自己一个人上来
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.19,1:14:48.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.13,1:14:52.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷 没事了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.40,1:15:02.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波波露 你来救我了啊 谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.57,1:15:04.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都平安吗
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.62,1:15:07.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的脚好像扭伤了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.32,1:15:09.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这种程度没关系
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.95,1:15:10.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.11,1:15:21.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太阳升得很高了 快要正午了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.22,1:15:23.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷 我现在就去救你
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.54,1:15:26.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 快想办法啊
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.66,1:15:30.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『空气炮』
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.35,1:15:31.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发射
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.00,1:15:35.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.44,1:15:42.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 快捂住鼻子
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.84,1:15:45.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,消失了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.48,1:15:47.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,犯人在那上面
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.29,1:15:51.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被识破了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.05,1:15:53.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是他用药迷惑我们
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.06,1:15:56.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『遥控天线』 跟 『胡椒粉』
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.00,1:15:57.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次轮到我们了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.65,1:15:59.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫 麻烦你控制了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.81,1:16:00.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OK
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.04,1:16:20.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.00,1:16:26.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶 怎么这么没用
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.67,1:16:28.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 快点
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.22,1:16:32.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 我们走 小夫
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.00,1:16:39.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.79,1:16:43.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于来了啊 王子
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.02,1:16:46.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷就在这里 想救她的话就上来
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.78,1:16:48.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就是尼迪娜吗
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.83,1:16:50.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蓝色狸猫 这里没你的事
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.94,1:16:53.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狸... 我不是什么狸猫
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.40,1:16:54.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.16,1:16:59.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好烫 好烫 好烫
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.72,1:17:03.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 没事吧 振作点
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.54,1:17:05.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没事
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.08,1:17:07.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 『百宝袋』烧没了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.66,1:17:12.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼迪娜 为什么要做这种事
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.68,1:17:14.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明知故问
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.28,1:17:18.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要用你做食之仪式的祭品
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.29,1:17:20.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用我做仪式的...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.40,1:17:24.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当黑暗女神吞噬太阳之时
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.50,1:17:27.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑暗吃掉太阳的时候？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.45,1:17:28.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是指日食
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.91,1:17:33.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到时候 我就能转移到祭品的身上
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.49,1:17:37.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后 我就能得到永生
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.27,1:17:40.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是说你要成为王子
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.25,1:17:42.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后支配玛雅娜国吗
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.58,1:17:45.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正是如此 真是聪明的小孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.51,1:17:47.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可不会让你得逞
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.53,1:17:50.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,休想妨碍我 歌德鲁 干掉他们
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.63,1:18:04.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.94,1:18:07.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子 上来
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.55,1:18:13.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了 王子 怕了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.75,1:18:14.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他并不是...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.78,1:18:15.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要说话
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.86,1:18:23.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下定决心了吗 这份勇气值得夸奖
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.29,1:18:28.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,食之仪式的时刻来临了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.31,1:18:32.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,日食开始了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.80,1:18:39.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要赶上才行
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.62,1:18:44.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.85,1:18:52.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎你 王子
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.85,1:18:59.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点开始交换
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.69,1:19:02.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『物件交换布』
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.65,1:19:03.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要做什么
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.87,1:19:06.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你带着『备用百宝袋』啊
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.39,1:19:07.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟石像交换
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.19,1:19:12.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什 什么
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.51,1:19:14.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不要做祭品
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.75,1:19:15.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想逃吗
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.59,1:19:16.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.50,1:19:17.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甘度
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.60,1:19:22.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我 放开我
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.20,1:19:25.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.40,1:19:43.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有破绽
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.54,1:19:49.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.03,1:19:50.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做得好 胖虎
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.41,1:19:52.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊沙姆师傅
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.21,1:19:55.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你平安无事啊
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.96,1:20:00.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,师傅
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.46,1:20:14.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,厉害 不愧是我的师傅
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.81,1:20:18.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.69,1:20:20.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我老实点
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.91,1:20:23.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死到临头还不认命啊 王子
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.55,1:20:26.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.07,1:20:37.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.12,1:20:41.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛雅娜国的人们
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.44,1:20:45.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不许跟我作对 你们来了又能怎样
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.34,1:20:48.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让你们见识一下我尼迪娜的力量
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.17,1:20:49.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.39,1:20:50.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.92,1:20:52.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是谁
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.75,1:20:53.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下吗
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.57,1:20:54.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么可能
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.78,1:20:57.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.39,1:21:00.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.16,1:21:07.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才是王子
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.02,1:21:09.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两个王子
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.98,1:21:10.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪奥
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.33,1:21:17.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竟然有两个王子
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.18,1:21:18.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.28,1:21:21.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪个 哪个才是真的
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.57,1:21:25.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是我远方而来朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.33,1:21:26.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开你的手
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.67,1:21:31.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要祭品的话 就用我吧
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.12,1:21:35.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下 请留步
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.47,1:21:38.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们需要王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.50,1:21:40.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁也不要过来
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.43,1:21:43.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对朋友弃之不顾 算什么王子
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.77,1:21:49.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 因为你 我第一次有了真正的朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.35,1:21:52.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对这些朋友 我不能见死不救
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.75,1:21:55.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪奥
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.65,1:21:58.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是好人啊 我不能坐视不管
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.86,1:22:00.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 胖虎
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.31,1:22:01.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是王子的决定
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.90,1:22:03.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.68,1:22:09.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我的朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.06,1:22:12.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开他
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.09,1:22:17.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪个都无所谓了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.39,1:22:24.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.75,1:22:25.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪奥
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.42,1:22:28.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别阻碍我
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.04,1:22:30.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪奥
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.94,1:22:34.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,认命吧
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.97,1:22:43.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.44,1:22:48.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有这个就什么都不用怕了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.62,1:22:49.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪奥 快逃
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.87,1:22:53.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住 想无论如何都违抗我吗
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.24,1:23:04.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.55,1:23:07.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪奥
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.29,1:23:09.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,射门
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.11,1:23:48.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是尼迪娜的本来面目
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.51,1:23:53.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼迪娜打算去哪儿
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.26,1:24:03.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.18,1:24:04.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,师傅
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.53,1:24:06.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼迪娜
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.14,1:24:08.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊沙姆师傅
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.17,1:24:13.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太迟了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.79,1:24:17.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.93,1:24:19.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.61,1:24:21.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神殿要塌了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.78,1:24:25.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快逃
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.42,1:24:30.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.99,1:24:41.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪奥
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.23,1:24:44.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 别管我 快走
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.27,1:24:45.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.32,1:24:47.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样下去我们都无法得救的
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.52,1:24:48.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开手
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.60,1:24:50.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我做不到
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.60,1:24:56.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么甘度会...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.61,1:24:58.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救了我们
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.54,1:25:02.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我给它吃了『桃太郎牌驯服丸子』
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.43,1:25:03.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.24,1:25:09.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.41,1:25:10.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪奥
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.59,1:25:13.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.59,1:25:33.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷 求求你 睁开眼睛吧
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.30,1:25:36.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来结局不能像童话故事那样完美
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.19,1:25:37.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.02,1:25:40.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.66,1:25:47.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.99,1:25:48.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.93,1:25:50.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于醒来了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.19,1:25:51.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.88,1:25:53.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷 你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.40,1:25:55.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.67,1:25:57.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有两个王子...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.80,1:25:59.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.94,1:26:01.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 快想办法啊
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.93,1:26:04.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想她很快就会没事的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.56,1:26:06.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,起来嘛 谷谷
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.52,1:26:11.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.52,1:26:25.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,母后 看到您这么精神真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.97,1:26:30.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪奥 你已经不再是王子了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.01,1:26:34.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要以太阳王的身份 好好统治这个王国
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.29,1:26:35.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,母后...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.93,1:26:41.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太阳王 万岁
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.98,1:26:52.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太阳王 万岁
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.76,1:27:01.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 波波露 再见了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.68,1:27:04.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.42,1:27:05.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了 哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.86,1:27:10.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『时空洞』的时空出问题了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.08,1:27:12.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不快点的话就回不去了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.04,1:27:16.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是说 已经不能再来这里吗
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.33,1:27:17.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能会那样
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.66,1:27:20.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波波露 帮我把这个还给迪奥
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.65,1:27:23.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 快点
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.88,1:27:30.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪奥 可能无法再见面了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.11,1:27:32.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我永远不会忘记你的
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.66,1:27:33.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见了 迪奥
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.97,1:27:35.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.96,1:27:56.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说 王子殿下的角色还是由我来当最合适
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.81,1:27:59.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不是这样 这次由我来当
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.71,1:28:01.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也想当
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.26,1:28:02.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香也要吗
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.21,1:28:03.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是这样太奇怪了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.83,1:28:04.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是这样吗
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.90,1:28:06.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 猜拳决定吧
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.87,1:28:08.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 就这样就这样
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.64,1:28:10.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们真好
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.57,1:28:13.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猜拳就能当王子了
